PushModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Low-level write primitive for the WASM output byte stream. Appends a single byte to the state["out"] list — the accumulating buffer of the generated module.
    Provides: Push(state, x) -> state. Appends byte x (Int) to state["out"], returns the updated state (same map, new out list). Pure, no external side effects.
    DependsOn: none (leaf; Core.MapGet/ListPush/MapSet only).
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../Push/Push.sir).
    Notes: state is the single emitter-state map threaded through the Emit* call chain; "out" is the output-WASM byte list. All other emission modules are built on top of Push/PushList.
